flowchart TD
    s([Shift start]) --> scan[Scan each shelf]
    scan --> more{More shelves?}
    more -->|More| scan
    more -->|None| cmp[Compare to books]
    cmp --> diff{Mismatch?}
    diff -->|No| ok([Close stocktake])
    diff -->|Yes| recount[Recount mismatches]
    recount --> still{Still off?}
    still -->|No| ok
    still -->|Yes| report[Write discrepancy report]
    report --> adjust[Adjust inventory]
    adjust --> ok
